<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of July 22 to July 25, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers for the 15th consecutive week.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   473.68 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  411.65 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  62.03 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying     292.86 billion yen</p>
</text>
